orroborate the reboot.","limitations":["No enabled repositories were available, so the captured yum update attempt ended before an actual update transaction; there is no direct repository-backed demonstration that another package updates while curl remains held.","The lifecycle package-health probe timed out both before and after execution, although targeted `rpm -V curl` verification succeeded after reboot.","Restart evidence directly covers the relevant curl package/configuration and general node recovery; there was no separate application data or cluster state applicable to this single-node package-hold task."]}
